4: for $k = 1$ to $K$ do   
5: $(y_{\mathcal{N}_k},conf_{\mathcal{N}_k}) = P_{\mathrm{LLM}}(u_{\mathcal{N}_k})$ {Prompt LLM to obtain predictions and confidences}   
6: $w_{k} = \mathrm{sim}(z_{0},z_{\mathcal{N}_{k}})$ {Compute neighbor weights based on similarity}   
